		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『なんだ　この　ふね？
なんで　こんなに　つめたいんだ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-24T03:40:12" />
