				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『なんだ　この　船？
なんで　こんなに　冷たいんだ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-24T05:52:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
